  "title": "Vizsla Silver Announces Closing of US$300 Million Convertible Senior Notes Offering - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia (November 24, 2025) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G3) (“Vizsla Silver” or the “Company”)today announced the closing of its previously announced offering of 5.00% convertible senior unsecured notes due 2031 (the “Notes”) for an aggregate principal amount of US$300 million (the “Offering”), which includes the exercise in full by the initial purchasers of […]",
